{"order": 4, "chunk_id": "2019_17_1_68a5c68342::chunk_00026", "doc_id": "2019_17_1_68a5c68342", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "hybrid_direct", "path": ["第三章 系统功能核验", "第一节 土建工程 线路和轨道"], "token_est": 42, "text": "第三十三条 作为疏散通道的道床面应平整、连续、无障碍; 轨行区至站台的疏散楼梯、疏散平台在联络通道处的坡道连接、区 间联络通道防火门开启等不应影响乘客紧急疏散.", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 13, "source_views": ["leaf_dense", "chunk_dense"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
{"order": 5, "chunk_id": "TB10623-2014_8076420db7::chunk_00006", "doc_id": "TB10623-2014_8076420db7", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "hybrid_direct", "path": [], "token_est": 64, "text": "7.规定了桥梁设计荷载和结构变形、变位、梁端转角和基 频、墩台刚度、墩台沉降的限值标准,提出了桥涵结构计算、构 造及结构形式选择的原则性要求. 8.规定了隧道轨面以上净空横断面面积,明确了荷载、隧 道衬砌、洞内附属构筑物、洞门结构、防排水、防灾救援等技术 要求.", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 7, "source_views": ["leaf_dense", "chunk_dense", "anchor_bm25"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
{"order": 6, "chunk_id": "TB10623-2014_8076420db7::chunk_00763", "doc_id": "TB10623-2014_8076420db7", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "hybrid_direct", "path": [], "token_est": 85, "text": "2 考虑紧急情况下的人员疏散及救援人员的通行要求, 兼顾一定的经济性,结合原铁道部《关于发布铁路工程地质勘 察规范等44项铁路工程建设标准局部修订条文的通知》(铁建 设〔2009〕62号)要求,提出5 km 以上的隧道应设应急照明; 而3 km 以上的隧道如设有紧急出口,也应设置应急照明,以 保证人员逃生需要; 另外,地下区间参照地铁设计的相关规范 也应设置应急照明.", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 5, "source_views": ["leaf_dense", "chunk_dense", "anchor_bm25"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
{"order": 7, "chunk_id": "2019_17_1_68a5c68342::chunk_00003", "doc_id": "2019_17_1_68a5c68342", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "hybrid_direct", "path": ["第一章 总 则"], "token_est": 33, "text": "第二条 新建地铁和轻轨工程项目初期运营前安全评估工作 适用本规范,改扩建项目和甩项工程适用本规范相关规定. 第二章 前提条件", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 21, "source_views": ["leaf_dense", "chunk_dense"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
{"order": 8, "chunk_id": "20221021_dccb715295::chunk_00095", "doc_id": "20221021_dccb715295", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "leaf_direct", "path": ["第九章 附 则"], "token_est": 100, "text": "第九章 附 则 第八十条 本条例所称轨道交通设施,包括轨道、路基、桥 梁、隧道、高架、车站、出入口、通风亭、冷却塔、变电所、集中冷站、控制中心、车辆基地、管线缆通道、区间风井、隔音屏障、人防设施等土建工程,车辆、供电、通风空调、通信、信号、 给排水、消防、防灾报警、环境设备监控、自动售检票、电梯、屏蔽门、防淹门、站台门、导向标志、乘客信息系统等系统设备,以及为保障轨道交通运营和为乘客提供便利服务而设置的其他相关设施.", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 11, "source_views": ["leaf_dense"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
{"order": 9, "chunk_id": "RIS-3782-TOM-Iss-1_1439aebfda::chunk_00010", "doc_id": "RIS-3782-TOM-Iss-1_1439aebfda", "role": "direct", "hit_type": "hybrid_direct", "path": ["Purpose and introduction", "1.2 Application of this document"], "token_est": 144, "text": "1.2 Application of this document 1.2.1 Compliance requirements and dates have not been specified because these are the subject of internal procedures or contract conditions. 1.2.2 If you plan to do something that does not comply with a requirement in this RIS, you can ask a Standards Committee to comment on your proposed alternative. If you want a Standards Committee to do this, please submit your deviation application form to RSSB. You can find advice and guidance on using alternative requirements on RSSB's website www.rssb.co.uk. 1.3 Health and safety responsibilities", "expansion_from": null, "retrieve_rank_fused": 6, "source_views": ["leaf_dense", "chunk_dense"], "query_id": "qt_005", "query": "8.9 防灾救援疏散工程有哪些要求", "query_type": "anchor", "tree_mode": "full_tree", "pack_summary": {"num_input_candidates": 110, "num_after_dedup": 96, "num_after_mmr": 20, "num_packed": 10, "used_tokens": 718, "budget_tokens": 2500}}
